  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Green Hero Solution &#x2013; A Circular Model for Climate-Resilient Food &amp; Agriculture in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To pilot a circular food system that reduces organic food waste, produces compost for urban agriculture, and strengthens food security and climate resilience for vulnerable communities in Vietnam. The project will divert significant amounts of organic waste from landfills, generate compost for two Green Hero Gardens, create green livelihood opportunities, and promote community engagement and policy dialogue on sustainable waste management and urban farming.</narrative>
  </description>
